# apps/api

Layers: `shared` (cross-layer helpers), `domain`, `application`, `infrastructure`, `interfaces`.

- Do not name a file after one function. Use `types.ts`, `constants.ts`, `schemas.ts`, `utils.ts`, or `middleware.ts` in the owning folder.
- Helpers used by every layer go in `src/shared/` (`formatError`, `REPO_ROOT`).
- Graph tools allowlist: `read_document`, `search_knowledge` only. Metrics stay on MCP.
- Express: `interfaces/http/app.ts`, `routes.ts`, one `middleware.ts`.
- `.env`, `knowledge/`, and `evals/` resolve from repo root via `REPO_ROOT`.
